          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-gamepad-2"><line x1="6" y1="11" x2="10" y2="11"/><line x1="8" y1="9" x2="8" y2="13"/><line x1="15" y1="12" x2="15.01" y2="12"/><line x1="18" y1="10" x2="18.01" y2="10"/><path d="M17.32 5H6.68a4 4 0 0 0-3.978 3.59c-.006.052-.01.101-.017.152C2.604 9.416 2 14.456 2 16a3 3 0 0 0 3 3c1 0 1.5-.5 2-1l1.414-1.414A2 2 0 0 1 9.828 16h4.344a2 2 0 0 1 1.414.586L17 18c.5.5 1 1 2 1a3 3 0 0 0 3-3c0-1.545-.604-6.584-.685-7.258-.007-.05-.011-.1-.017-.151A4 4 0 0 0 17.32 5z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold mb-2 text-gray-900 dark:text-white">游戏必备</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">完美适配王者荣耀、和平精英、LOL手游等热门游戏，让你的ID与众不同。</p>
